  "body": "Support 2-axis lathe dialects in `camcraft-gcode` and connect them to CamCraft's turning simulation.\n\n## Scope\n- Parse `fanuc-lathe.cps` and `tormach-lathe.cps` dialects: `G18` XZ plane, `G7` diameter / `G8` radius X mode, `G95`/`G99` feed per revolution (using active `S`), `G96`/`G97` with `G50` rpm clamp, `T0101` tool+offset, and `G32`/`G33`/`G76` threading passes.\n- Route parsed turning paths into `stock_sim::lathe` (`Stock::simulate_lathe_profile` in `crates/app/src/stock_sim_lathe.rs`) in the field engine.\n- Refuse milling-only words or missing spindle speed for `G95`/`G99` moves by name with the 1-based line number.\n\nDepends on #2217 and #2218.\n\nDone means: Tests read back `fanuc-lathe.cps` and `tormach-lathe.cps` golden programs into lathe `cl::Toolpath` moves and simulate revolved stock removal via `Stock::simulate_lathe_profile`.\n\nPart of #2213\n",
